(
    title: "Video Life",
    description: Some("There is no score to chase — you draw a pattern of dots, set it running, and watch each generation replace the last about once a second under Conway\'s rules. Growth stops the moment you touch the pattern again, so you can add or erase a dot and set it going afresh; patterns reaching an edge wrap round to the opposite side."),
